     1,
     "<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2012/9/11  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">taiwa...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\n<div style=\"font-family:arial;font-weight:bold;color:#222222;padding:0px\"> \n  <a name=\"m_-6489420229875992565_139b1f0de1a78384_digest_top\" style=\"color:#222222\" rel=\"nofollow\">今日主題摘要</a></div>\n<p>Google 網上論壇: <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238957812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02ky6VNMrP-KlqlNTbXcZt\">http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/topics</a></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\n<li type=\"square\" style=\"color:#555555\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-6489420229875992565_139b1f0de1a78384_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">如何將Excel資料匯入至R並進行部分資料的轉置處理</a> [3 則更新]</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n\n\n  \n  <a name=\"m_-6489420229875992565_139b1f0de1a78384_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/t/161f27d6eabe8605\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/t/161f27d6eabe8605&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238957812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mLpRo1sLmp2xzEtmxVXE7\">如何將Excel資料匯入至R並進行部分資料的轉置處理</a></div>\n\n\n  \n  <ul>\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">WEPA ^_^ &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">alan...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Sep 09 10:19PM -0700\n       <br><br>\n      感謝 James 提及以下之問題：<br>\n <br>\n <br>\n考慮每天24小時且每小時檢測並記錄20\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/msg/6de7dbb04b90c8cd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/msg/6de7dbb04b90c8cd&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238957812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2DAjMGVlpgfI_M824aAGVi\">...更多</a><br>\n    </div>\n  </ul>\n  \n  <ul>\n    <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">WEPA ^_^ &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">alan...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Sep 09 10:27PM -0700\n       <br><br>\n      請參考以下R程式碼，主要利用* t( )* 指令將資料進行轉置，如有任何問題，歡迎再討論XD<br>\n <br>\n#####<br>\n# Title: How to load and transfer raw data to Excel<br>\n# Date: 2012/9/10\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/msg/620ecf98c4a9e68d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/msg/620ecf98c4a9e68d&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238957812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3RrmASjCa5ktQYnsSjvaBH\">...更多</a><br>\n    </div>\n  </ul>\n  \n  <ul>\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">WEPA ^_^ &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">alan...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Sep 09 10:50PM -0700\n       <br><br>\n      請將 write.table( ) 改為以下指令, 輸出才正確:<br>\n <br>\n# export to csv file<br>\nwrite.csv(weather.finish, file=&quot;weather.finish.csv&quot;, row.names = FALSE)<br>\n# end<br>\n <br>\n <br>\nWEPA ^_^於\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/msg/5ce916f2ee30a354\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/msg/5ce916f2ee30a354&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238957812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38M2NmPSxBTwlk3xv2Gqj_\">...更多</a><br>\n    </div>\n  </ul>\n  \n\n\n\n  <div style=\"color:#555555;padding:27px 0 0 40px\">\n  <p>\n    這是「Google 網上論壇」針對「taiwanruser」群組發送的訂閱通知郵件。<br>\n    您可以<a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">透過電子郵件張貼留言</a>。<br>\n    如要取消訂閱這個群組，請<a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">傳送</a>一封空白的郵件。<br>\n    如需更多選項，請<a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238957812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02ky6VNMrP-KlqlNTbXcZt\">造訪</a>這個群組。<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>\n  </font></span></p><span><font color=\"#888888\">\n\n<p></p>\n\n-- <br>\n===========================================================<br>\n您收到此郵件，是因為您訂閱了 Google 網上論壇的「R軟體使用者論壇」群組。<br>\n如要在此群組張貼留言，請到下面網址：<br>\n <br>\nR軟體使用者論壇：<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238957812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0iWNQLF2PKDwJAcjjJNvmG\">https://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser</a><br>\n <br>\n如有興趣深入瞭解R軟體或資料分析，請到下面網址：<br>\n<a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/zhonghuarruantixuehui/home/learn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sites.google.com/site/zhonghuarruantixuehui/home/learn&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238957812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw11Kk8M0bjPu8OJ2zM4dVp3\">https://sites.google.com/site/zhonghuarruantixuehui/home/learn</a><br>\n<a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/rdataanalysis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.facebook.com/rdataanalysis&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238957812000&amp;usg=AOvVaw30dh-N0hg0aJ06lPzvMLn6\">http://www.facebook.com/rdataanalysis</a><br>\n <br>\n===========================================================<br>\n</font></span></div></blockquote></div><br><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:23px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">祝顺/Best Regards</span><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:23px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n王邦柱 | Bangzhu Wang</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:23px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(128,128,128)\">中国科学院电工研究所超导电力科学技术研究发展中心<div><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;line-height:18px\">Center for Superconducting Power Technology,</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana;line-height:18px\"> Institute of Electrical Engineering, Chinese Academy of Sciences</span> <div>\n<div>Tel: 86-10-82681187   |    Mob: 13811043755</div><div>Email: <a href style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">uabu...@126.com</a></div></div></div></span></div><br>\n"
